    "societal_benefit": {
      "en": "Shower shelving is normally a suction-cup product that fails, or an over-priced caddy sized for nothing in particular. Fitting the ring, hook, or clip to a real bottle body or pump neck lets anyone screw-mount a bracket that holds the bottle they actually use, reducing plastic-organizer churn and keeping the last of every bottle drainable.",
      "es": "La repisa de ducha suele ser un producto de ventosa que falla, o una caja sobrevalorada sin medida real. Ajustar el anillo, gancho o clip a un cuerpo o cuello de bomba reales permite atornillar un soporte que sujete la botella que realmente usas, reduciendo el recambio de organizadores plásticos."
